Marshal Chris Adams turns down a friend's request to help stop
the depredations of a gang of Mexican bandits.

4
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
When his wife is killed by bank robbers and his friend is killed capturing the last thief, Chris feels obligated to take up his friend's cause and
recruits a writer and five prisoners to destroy the desperadoes.The last in the original series of four "Magnificent Seven" movies.

